{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"U_kgDOCUT68w","is_bot":false,"login":"ChaiXinLong-tech","name":""},"body":"Parent: #33\n/bounty $50\n\n## Scope\nAdd a focused TaskFlow API utility for detecting the Unicode word joiner character (U+2060) in a string.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Add $helperPath exporting $fn(input: string): boolean.\n- Return \true only when the input contains the word joiner character.\n- Keep the helper dependency-free and safe for reuse in API validation paths.\n- Include local TypeScript proof for positive, negative, and empty-string cases.","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABItOW0g","author":{"login":"voladoradepapantla-netizen"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Starting this now. I'll keep the scope to the requested helper plus its local test.","createdAt":"2026-07-03T20:47:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/5005#issuecomment-4879259346","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABItOnEw","author":{"login":"voladoradepapantla-netizen"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"PR is up: https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/pull/5042","createdAt":"2026-07-03T20:48:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/5005#issuecomment-4879263507","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABIz7Bzg","author":{"login":"yanyishuai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Claiming #5005 — `isWordJoinerPresent`. /claim #5005","createdAt":"2026-07-05T13:53:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/5005#issuecomment-4886282702","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABI0Bs_g","author":{"login":"yanyishuai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@voladoradepapantla-netizen — **Our open PR for this issu